  "ruleText": "Env-A 3304.02 Operating Practices for Small MWC Units. The operating practices applicable to each small MWC unit shall be as specified in 40 CFR §§60.1690 and 60.1695.\n\nSource. #7704, eff 6-7-02; ss by #9084, eff 2-2-08; ss by #11131, eff 7-18-16; ss by #12628, eff 9-27-18; ss by #12628, eff 9-27-18",
